<%@ page pageEncoding="UTF-8" %>
<%@ page contentType="text/html; charset=UTF-8" %>
<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title><%=request.getAttribute("workspaceTitle")%> · TorchNode</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/observatory.css"></head><body><%@ include file="layout.jsp" %><main class="shell"><h1><%=request.getAttribute("workspaceTitle")%></h1><p>Evidence recorded by this observer. Counts describe a vantage-point sample, never the entire Ethereum network.</p>
<section class="scope-panel"><div><h2>Measurement window</h2><p>UTC [start, end). Untimed legacy evidence remains excluded.</p></div><div class="scope-controls"><label for="measurement-scope">Quick range</label><select id="measurement-scope"><option value="1">Last 24 hours</option><option value="7">Last 7 days</option><option value="30">Last 30 days</option></select><button id="refresh-measurement" type="button">Refresh</button><a class="button secondary" href="/explorer">Explore nodes / stored evidence</a></div></section>
<p id="measurement-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">Loading measurements…</p><div id="visual-analytics" data-admin="<%= Boolean.TRUE.equals(request.getAttribute("isAdmin")) %>" class="visual-grid" data-page="<%=request.getAttribute("workspacePage")%>"></div></main><script nonce="<%= request.getAttribute("cspNonce") %>" type="module" src="/assets/dashboard-v2.js"></script></body></html>
